🧩 STEP 2: AUTO-SELECT SECTION FROM LINK

Still in Screen1.OnVisible:

Set(
    varSectionName,
    Param("section")
);

Set(
    varSelectedSection,
    LookUp(
        'SE Section List',
        Title = varSectionName
    )
);


---

🧩 STEP 3: SET DROPDOWN DEFAULT

Select Dropdown_Section

Default = varSelectedSection.Title


---

🧩 STEP 4: LOAD QUESTIONS + CHECK ACCESS (ONVISIBLE)

Still in Screen1.OnVisible:

// Load questions
ClearCollect(
    colQuestions,
    Filter(
        'SE Question List',
        'Section In-charge'.Value = varSelectedSection.Title
    )
);

// Check access
Set(
    varHasAccess,
    CountRows(
        Filter(
            colAccess,
            Section.Value = varSelectedSection.Title &&
            User.Claims = "i:0#.f|membership|" & User().Email
        )
    ) > 0
);


